description.desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launch up to 4 Slashes forward, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
<color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color> 4th hit is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight Skill]</color>;

While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight's Focus]</color> state with available <color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color> counts, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Activates the corresponding Alt Attack based on the current stage, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
<color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color> has 3 stages in total, and each use increases the stage count;
Using Alt Attack after a Basic Attack retains the Basic Attack stage count;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Evade> to activate:
A quick dash dodge;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> during a <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color> to activate:
Condenses ice at the gun barrel to deliver a powerful counter against enemies ahead, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
Triggering a <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color> and performing a Dodge Counter during a Basic Attack preserves the current Basic Attack combo count;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>Knight Skill</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When a <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Attack]</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Launch a powerful Pierce against enemies ahead, dealing massive <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
Gain 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Buff]</color>. Each stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Buff]</color> increases DMG dealt by subsequent Alt Attacks by 15%, stacking up to 2 times. After the 3rd stage Alt Attack ends, remove <color=#FFFFFF>[All-Out Assault State]</color> and <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Buff]</color>;
When this skill hits a Dazed Elite or Boss-Rank enemy for the first time, it records the current <color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color> stage and enters <color=#FFFFFF>[All-Out Assault State]</color>. This effect can trigger at most once per Daze;
While in <color=#FFFFFF>[All-Out Assault State]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight's Focus]</color> duration does not decrease, and holding <IconMap:Icon_Normal> allows continuous use of Alt Attack stages 1 through 3;
After executing <color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color> Stage 3, exit <color=#FFFFFF>[All-Out Assault State]</color> and restore the <color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color> stage count;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight Skill]</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Decibel Rating is at <color=#FFFFFF>Maximum</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_UltimateReady> to activate:
Channels the power of extreme cold to unleash a devastating series of charges forward, dealing massive <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>Knight Skill</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

desc:
Triggers when your squad has a <color=#FFFFFF>[Support]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[Stun]</color> Character:
Upon triggering, your DMG dealt increases by 40%;
When a teammate triggers a Fire Anomaly, or you trigger Wind Contamination, gain 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Buff]</color>;

Triggers when your squad has a <color=#FFFFFF>[Support]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[Stun]</color> Character:
Upon triggering, your DMG dealt increases by 40%;
When a teammate triggers a Fire Anomaly, or you trigger Wind Contamination, gain 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Buff]</color>;

The 4th hit of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Attack]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate]</color>, and <color=#FFFFFF>[Dodge Counter]</color> are considered <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight Skills]</color>;
When Sigrid hits an enemy with any <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight Skill]</color>, if not currently in <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight's Focus]</color>, she enters <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight's Focus]</color>, and the <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight Skill]</color> that landed the hit enters <color=#FFFFFF>[Inactive]</color> status. She also gains 1 <color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color> charge, up to a maximum of 1;
While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight's Focus]</color>, when Sigrid uses any <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight Skill]</color> that is not in <color=#FFFFFF>[Inactive]</color> status, she can refresh <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight's Focus]</color> and gain 1 <color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color> charge, up to a maximum of 1. Upon refreshing <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight's Focus]</color>, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Inactive]</color> status transfers to the newly used <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight Skill]</color>;
When an <color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color> hits an enemy, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Inactive]</color> status is removed, and the next <color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color>'s tier increases by 1, up to a maximum of 3. After the 3rd-tier <color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color>, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color> tier immediately resets to 1 and <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight's Focus]</color> ends;
The duration of <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight's Focus]</color> decreases as the <color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color> tier increases: at tiers 1/2/3, the duration is <color=#FFFFFF>8</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>7</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>6</color>s respectively;
When <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight's Focus]</color> ends, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Alt Attack]</color> tier decreases by 1, down to a minimum of 1;
When <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight's Focus]</color> is activated or refreshed, Sigrid's CRIT Rate increases by <color=#2BAD00>33%</color> for <color=#FFFFFF>8</color>s. Repeated triggers can extend the duration by <color=#FFFFFF>8</color>s, up to a maximum duration of <color=#FFFFFF>40</color>s;
While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Knight's Focus]</color>, the Energy Cost of <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> is reduced.

